      "parameters": {
        "content": "##Guide of these workflow\n**1 node**: Trigger every 5 minutes.\n\n**2nd node**: make HTTP request and get all incomplete executions from make.com Lead qualification final capstone scenario\n\n**3rd node**: Split the whole array into single single batches\n\n**4th node** : Loop over each item comes from split node \n\n**5th node**: Get row from health sheet and checks whether these log is already logged or not though execution id \n\n**IF node** : If previous node gives empty means new error then Append in sheet and back to loop \nIf that log is exist then skip the append and goto loop for next items\n\n**Slack node** : After execution one alert will be sent to Slack node \n"
      },
